Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.49,0:23:02.34,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}iyasenu mama kaze ga fuiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:23:02.34,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}cannot heal all the tears in it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.49,0:23:02.34,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}cannot heal all the tears in it
