Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.03,0:23:12.50,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(0,250)}kawaita hitomi de dareka naite kure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.03,0:23:12.50,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(0,250)}Someone, cry for me with parched eyes
