Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No regrets about the woman who ran away,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.01,0:24:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but a small thorn still pricks the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.18,0:24:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting one flow along with time itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.73,0:24:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,living all alone from that day to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.55,0:24:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But to the sounds of waves that come and go,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the migrating birds find their hearts drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.57,0:24:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Ganymede Elegy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.13,0:24:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet Black will sing it up full of soul.
